                "WFCommentActionText": "Check if a string contains both “goo” and “maps” in any order. This is equivalent to saying:\n• The string must contain “goo”\nAND\n• The string must contain “maps”\n─────────────\nSample URLs (Both point to the same location):\n• Desktop: https://www.google.com/maps/place/St.+John's+Church/@53.2483093,10.4149357,17z/data=!4m6!3m5!1s0x47b1ddcfc50cca5d:0xe4c8bd81a1fb7825!8m2!3d53.2478376!4d10.4128873!16zL20vMDl2a3Rj?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI0MTIxMS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D\n• Mobile: https://maps.app.goo.gl/FBx6hHeotTwrQ4YD6"
            }
